    "key": "okkyung lee",
    "name": "Okkyung Lee",
    "slots": {
      "origin": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "Okkyung Lee（李玉京）1975 年生於南韓大田，是大提琴家、即興演奏者與作曲者。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okkyung_Lee",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://college.berklee.edu/node/2382706"
          },
          {
            "f": "她童年在首爾上專業的音樂與美術學校；12 歲時父親的朋友從紐約出差帶回一把狀況不佳的大提琴，修好後成了她長年的主力琴。",
            "src": "https://www.attnmagazine.co.uk/interview-okkyung-lee/",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "她 1993 年赴波士頓，進 Berklee 學院，1998 年取得當代寫作與製作、電影配樂雙學位，之後在新英格蘭音樂學院拿到當代即興碩士。",
            "src": "https://college.berklee.edu/node/2382706",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okkyung_Lee"
          },
          {
            "f": "2000 年她搬到紐約，投入下城（downtown）實驗音樂圈；她說紐約讓她接觸更多樂手，逼自己發展不同的演奏做法。",
            "src": "https://college.berklee.edu/node/2382706",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okkyung_Lee"
          }
        ]
      },
      "sound": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "她的風格把古典與韓國傳統的根底和自由即興結合；她說自己用大提琴拉噪音，是因為和這件樂器有很深的個人連結，演出時有時會把弓毛拉到碎裂。",
            "src": "https://college.berklee.edu/node/2382706",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "她說沒有哪個人單獨塑造了她的演奏，與電子音樂人和鼓手合作、避免重複，把她的耳朵推向傳統大提琴以外的聲音。",
            "src": "https://www.attnmagazine.co.uk/interview-okkyung-lee/",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "Attn 雜誌形容她的現場急迫而且身體感強烈，聲音由身體、琴與弓一起產生。",
            "src": "https://www.attnmagazine.co.uk/interview-okkyung-lee/",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "legacy": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "她 2010 年獲 Foundation for Contemporary Arts 補助，2015 年獲 Doris Duke Performing Artist Award。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okkyung_Lee",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://college.berklee.edu/node/2382706"
          },
          {
            "f": "她合作過的人橫跨即興與前衛圈，包括 Laurie Anderson、John Zorn、Christian Marclay、Butch Morris、Lasse Marhaug、Vijay Iyer 等。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okkyung_Lee",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://www.attnmagazine.co.uk/interview-okkyung-lee/"
          },
          {
            "f": "她 2013 年策劃奧地利 Wels 的 Music Unlimited 音樂節。",
            "src": "https://college.berklee.edu/node/2382706",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "era": {
