  {
    "key": "stalaggh",
    "name": "Stalaggh",
    "slots": {
      "origin": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "Stalaggh 是匿名的荷蘭與比利時極端音樂計畫，成員來自兩國的黑金屬與工業圈，從未公開身分、也拒絕被拍照。",
            "src": "https://weirdretro.org.uk/stalagghgulaggh-music-from-damaged-minds.html",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://www.vice.com/en/article/revisiting-the-most-terrifying-album-of-all-time"
          },
          {
            "f": "團名據稱取自「Stalag」（納粹戰俘營）一詞，計畫主題與此相關；他們自稱做的是「Nihilistik Misanthropik Audio-Terrror」，座右銘是「Existence is futile」。",
            "src": "https://weirdretro.org.uk/stalagghgulaggh-music-from-damaged-minds.html",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "他們依序發行 Projekt Nihil、Projekt Terrror、Projekt Misanthropia 三部曲，各有概念：生存的徒勞、製造恐懼、厭世。",
            "src": "https://weirdretro.org.uk/stalagghgulaggh-music-from-damaged-minds.html",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://www.vice.com/en/article/revisiting-the-most-terrifying-album-of-all-time"
          }
        ]
      },
      "sound": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "音樂是噪音、drone、氛圍與黑金屬的混合，疊上層層人聲；評者認為「噪音」或「危險音樂」比黑金屬更貼切。",
            "src": "https://weirdretro.org.uk/stalagghgulaggh-music-from-damaged-minds.html",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "Projekt Misanthropia 是 35 分鐘的單一長曲；樂團自稱人聲來自荷蘭精神療養機構的病人，以書面同意錄製，說是一種原始吶喊療法。這些是樂團自述，外界無法獨立驗證，VICE 作者對此持懷疑。",
            "src": "https://www.vice.com/en/article/revisiting-the-most-terrifying-album-of-all-time",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://weirdretro.org.uk/stalagghgulaggh-music-from-damaged-minds.html"
          },
          {
            "f": "樂團自述要做出最壓迫、最難以聆聽的噪音。",
            "src": "https://www.vice.com/en/article/revisiting-the-most-terrifying-album-of-all-time",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "legacy": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "VICE（Noisey）在 2017 年重新刊出回顧，稱 Projekt Misanthropia 可能是有史以來最可怕的唱片之一。",
            "src": "https://www.vice.com/en/article/revisiting-the-most-terrifying-album-of-all-time",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "錄音方式的倫理爭議長期被提起，維基以外的專題文章也稱它是最令人不安的極端音樂之一。",
            "src": "https://weirdretro.org.uk/stalagghgulaggh-music-from-damaged-minds.html",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://www.vice.com/en/article/revisiting-the-most-terrifying-album-of-all-time"
          },
          {
            "f": "三部曲結束後，這個計畫改名 Gulaggh，主題轉向蘇聯勞改營，另有 Vorkuta 等作；Gulaggh 把 Stalaggh 的做法延伸，改用管弦樂器。",
            "src": "https://www.vice.com/en/article/revisiting-the-most-terrifying-album-of-all-time",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://weirdretro.org.uk/stalagghgulaggh-music-from-damaged-minds.html"
          }
        ]
      },
      "era": {
        "status": "none",
        "facts": []
      }
    },
    "milestones": [],
    "conflicts": [],
    "pubIssues": [],
    "searches": 3,
    "failedFetches": 0,
    "status": "thin",
    "notes": "poolAlbums 空；身分依研究層 Projekt Misanthropia 稿。維基無條目（en null）。成軍與解散年來源不一：metalkingdom 2000–2008，last.fm 約 2001，VICE 未說，另有說 2007 宣告結束；改名 Gulaggh 年份亦不一（2007 或 2008 後）→ 一律不收年份，寫作勿寫。「精神病患錄音」寫成樂團自稱。「最可怕唱片之一」為 VICE 單一媒體說法，寫作用「VICE 稱」。未找到任何來源稱它是最極端專輯，不收。metalkingdom 為資料庫站（2000–2008 成軍年僅此一源）。後輩點名、獎項、國家級共識均查不到；legacy 以爭議與知名度為主，標 thin。成員死因案情一概不收；VICE 轉述的患者個案不寫。weirdretro 與 VICE 為獨立站。"
  },
