        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "Orthrelm 是來自華盛頓特區的雙人團，Mick Barr 彈吉他、Josh Blair 打鼓。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orthrelm",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://archive.ctm-festival.de/index.php?id=2091"
          },
          {
            "f": "Barr 同時有 Crom-Tech、Octis、Quixotic 等計畫，並曾為 Flying Luttenbachers 彈吉他；Blair 還在 ABCs、WWIII、Supersystem 打過鼓。",
            "src": "https://archive.ctm-festival.de/index.php?id=2091",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "兩人高中就開始玩音樂；早期 Barr 寫曲、Blair 在他的素材上編鼓，後來的錄音更是共同創作。",
            "src": "https://www.northernexpress.com/news/music/article-1986-challenge-your-ears-with-orthrelm/",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "sound": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "早期錄音完全避開重複，沒有副歌、沒有重複的 riff，是高速、密集、不解決的金屬極端面，曲子往往只有一兩分鐘。",
            "src": "https://archive.ctm-festival.de/index.php?id=2091",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://www.northernexpress.com/news/music/article-1986-challenge-your-ears-with-orthrelm/"
          },
          {
            "f": "2005 年的 OV 轉向重複：整張一首約 45 分鐘，借用摩洛哥迷幻舞曲（trance）的雙大鼓與快速撥弦對答，也帶有 Tony Conrad 式早期極簡主義的味道。",
            "src": "https://www.orlandoweekly.com/news/subtle-concussions-2253627/",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://archive.ctm-festival.de/index.php?id=2091"
          },
          {
            "f": "Exclaim! 稱他們是結合自由爵士拍號、金屬 riff 與前衛搖滾設計的 noise metal 雙人組。",
            "src": "https://exclaim.ca/music/article/orthrelm-ov",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "現場兩人幾乎不動、極度專注，一場連續演奏約半小時。",
            "src": "https://archive.ctm-festival.de/index.php?id=2091",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "legacy": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "OV 獲得 Plug Awards 的 Best Avant Garde Album（前衛專輯）提名，同組提名者包括 Animal Collective、Black Dice、Boredoms。",
            "src": "https://www.orlandoweekly.com/news/subtle-concussions-2253627/",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://www.northernexpress.com/news/music/article-1986-challenge-your-ears-with-orthrelm/"
          },
          {
            "f": "Pitchfork 的 Dominique Leone 稱 OV 是 a towering achievement。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OV_(album)",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "聽眾反應兩極：有人狂熱，也有人敵意，Blair 說過演出時有人叫罵、丟菸灰缸；樂團當時靠巡迴慢慢累積核心聽眾。",
            "src": "https://www.northernexpress.com/news/music/article-1986-challenge-your-ears-with-orthrelm/",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://www.orlandoweekly.com/news/subtle-concussions-2253627/"
